::GEO_U02_L03_Q01::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L03_Q01<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.3<br><br>Question:<br>Which phrase describes a transformation sequence? {
= Two or more transformations performed in order#Correct. This answer matches the lesson concept and uses transformation evidence.
~ A single plotted point#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
~ A list of angle measures#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
~ A figure color pattern#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
}

