~ Translation symmetry#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
~ Reflection symmetry#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
= Rotation symmetry#Correct. This answer matches the lesson concept and uses transformation evidence.
