Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L03_Q07<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.4<br><br>Question:<br>Which evidence supports rotation symmetry? {
~ A figure looks balanced#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
~ A figure has labels#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
