~ The figure is large#This choice reflects a misconception about transformation sequences or symmetry. Check the order of transformations and the evidence that maps the figure.
}

::GEO_U02_L03_Q08::
Question ID:<br>GEO_U02_L03_Q08<br><br>MLA Standard:<br>MLA.GEO.CGM.3<br><br>Question:<br>Which sequence maps (1, 1) to (-1, 1), then to (-1, 4)? {
